    "Error code: SAP-H1\n\nLogin Items permission is already granted (status 1), but macOS still will not start the helper. This usually means Sapphire’s own helper registration is stuck.\n\nClick “Reset Helper” below. Sapphire will unregister the helper and register it again, then relaunch if the helper is still having issues.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding, app menus, helper, shared utilities, public build placeholders",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Error code: SAP-H1\n\nLogin Items permission is already granted (status 1), but macOS still will not start the helper. This usually means Sapphire’s own helper registration is stuck.\n\nClick “Reset Helper” below. Sapphire will unregister the helper and register it again, then relaunch if the helper is still having issues."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "错误代码：SAP-H1\n\n登录项权限已授予（状态 1），但 macOS 仍无法启动辅助服务。通常是 Sapphire 自身的辅助服务注册出现了问题。\n\n请点击下方“重置辅助服务”。Sapphire 将注销并重新注册辅助服务；如果仍有问题，应用会重新启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Error code: SAP-H2\n\nmacOS registered the helper but is waiting for your permission (SMAppService status 2).\n\nDo this:\n1. Click “Open Login Items” below.\n2. Under Allow in the Background, turn on Sapphire.\n3. Authenticate if macOS asks for your password.\n4. Return to Sapphire and click Install / Activate.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding, app menus, helper, shared utilities, public build placeholders",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Error code: SAP-H2\n\nmacOS registered the helper but is waiting for your permission (SMAppService status 2).\n\nDo this:\n1. Click “Open Login Items” below.\n2. Under Allow in the Background, turn on Sapphire.\n3. Authenticate if macOS asks for your password.\n4. Return to Sapphire and click Install / Activate."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "错误代码：SAP-H2\n\nmacOS 已注册辅助服务，正在等待你的许可（SMAppService 状态 2）。\n\n请按以下步骤操作：\n1. 点击下方“打开登录项”。\n2. 在“允许在后台”中启用 Sapphire。\n3. 如果 macOS 要求输入密码，请完成验证。\n4. 返回 Sapphire，点击“安装”或“激活”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Error code: SAP-H3\n\nmacOS can't find the helper.\n\nDo fix this:\n1. Click “Reset Helper” below. Sapphire will unregister the helper with SMAppService and register it again.\n2. If the helper still does not start, Sapphire will relaunch itself — or click “Relaunch Sapphire”.\n3. When Sapphire opens, click Install if asked.\n4. In System Settings → General → Login Items, enable Sapphire Helper under Allow in the Background.\n\nTry Reset Helper first. Only relaunch the app if the helper is still stuck after that.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding, app menus, helper, shared utilities, public build placeholders",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Error code: SAP-H3\n\nmacOS can't find the helper.\n\nDo fix this:\n1. Click “Reset Helper” below. Sapphire will unregister the helper with SMAppService and register it again.\n2. If the helper still does not start, Sapphire will relaunch itself — or click “Relaunch Sapphire”.\n3. When Sapphire opens, click Install if asked.\n4. In System Settings → General → Login Items, enable Sapphire Helper under Allow in the Background.\n\nTry Reset Helper first. Only relaunch the app if the helper is still stuck after that."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "错误代码：SAP-H3\n\nmacOS 找不到辅助服务。\n\n请按以下步骤修复：\n1. 点击下方“重置辅助服务”。Sapphire 将通过 SMAppService 注销辅助服务并重新注册。\n2. 如果辅助服务仍无法启动，Sapphire 会自行重新启动，你也可以点击“重新启动 Sapphire”。\n3. Sapphire 打开后，如出现提示，请点击“安装”。\n4. 在“系统设置”→“通用”→“登录项”的“允许在后台”中启用 Sapphire Helper。\n\n请先尝试重置辅助服务。仅在辅助服务仍未恢复时重新启动应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
