    "Sapphire is running through an application symlink. Move the real app into Applications before updating.": {
      "comment": "Settings dynamic presentation at literal source; reconcile with final compiler extraction.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
