          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 正通过应用符号链接运行。请先将实际应用移到“应用程序”文件夹再更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire isn't in a user-writable location. Install or repair the privileged helper, then use the standard install method.": {
      "comment": "Settings dynamic presentation at literal source; reconcile with final compiler extraction.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire isn't in a user-writable location. Install or repair the privileged helper, then use the standard install method."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 所在位置不允许当前用户写入。请安装或修复特权辅助工具，再使用标准安装方式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire lost connection to its system helper.\n\nClick “Reset Helper” to unregister Sapphire’s own background items, reinstall the helper, and relaunch. Other apps are not affected.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding, app menus, helper, shared utilities, public build placeholders",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire lost connection to its system helper.\n\nClick “Reset Helper” to unregister Sapphire’s own background items, reinstall the helper, and relaunch. Other apps are not affected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 与系统辅助服务的连接已断开。\n\n点击“重置辅助服务”可注销 Sapphire 自身的后台项目、重新安装辅助服务并重新启动应用。其他应用不会受到影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire needs a few permissions for its core features.": {
      "comment": "User-facing Sapphire interface text. Keep product names and interpolated user content unchanged.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire needs a few permissions for its core features."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 的核心功能需要部分系统权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire needs a privileged helper for battery management and system integrations. macOS will ask you to allow it under Login Items → Background Activity.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding, app menus, helper, shared utilities, public build placeholders",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire needs a privileged helper for battery management and system integrations. macOS will ask you to allow it under Login Items → Background Activity."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 需要具有管理员权限的辅助服务来管理电池和集成系统功能。macOS 会要求你在“登录项”→“后台活动”中允许该服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire never permanently deletes Trash contents; review and empty Trash in Finder when ready": {
      "comment": "Settings dynamic presentation at literal source; reconcile with final compiler extraction.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire never permanently deletes Trash contents; review and empty Trash in Finder when ready"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire 不会永久删除废纸篓内容；请在访达中检查，并在确认后清空废纸篓"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sapphire refused to remove an unsafe path: %@": {
      "comment": "Settings dynamic interpolated presentation; key and placeholder types verified against module-build-01 compiler output.",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sapphire refused to remove an unsafe path: %@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
